{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118461","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118461/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118461/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118461/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118461","id":4246519108,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc79HL1E","number":118461,"title":"Unbounded alloca() in RigidBody3D can overflow stack","user":{"login":"rayamazaky","id":238893411,"node_id":"U_kgDODj05Yw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238893411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky","html_url":"https://github.com/rayamazaky","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-12T04:28:07Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T09:17:13Z","closed_at":"2026-04-13T09:16:44Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.dev\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn `scene/3d/physics/rigid_body_3d.cpp:201-203`, stack allocations use `alloca()` with sizes not bounded by `max_contacts_reported`:\n\n```cpp\nint rc = 0;\nfor (KeyValue<ObjectID, BodyState> &E : contact_monitor->body_map) {\n    for (int i = 0; i < E.value.shapes.size(); i++) {\n        E.value.shapes[i].tagged = false;\n        rc++;\n    }\n}\n\n_RigidBodyInOut *toadd = (_RigidBodyInOut *)alloca(p_state->get_contact_count() * sizeof(_RigidBodyInOut));\nint toadd_count = 0;\nRigidBody3D_RemoveAction *toremove = (RigidBody3D_RemoveAction *)alloca(rc * sizeof(RigidBody3D_RemoveAction));\n```\n\n`rc` counts ALL shape pairs across all colliding bodies, which is NOT bounded by `max_contacts_reported`. If a RigidBody3D is in contact with many bodies that have many shapes, `rc` can be very large, and `alloca()` allocates on the stack with no overflow recovery.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a RigidBody3D with `contact_monitor` enabled.\n2. Place it in contact with many bodies, each having many shapes.\n3. Stack overflow crash.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A — unbounded stack allocation visible from source analysis.","closed_by":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starr